# Security & PII

- RLS default-deny; anon reads published/active only.
- No public INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE policies — form writes use service role after Turnstile + rate limit + validate.
- `profiles` not client-writable; roles via service-role / dashboard only.
- `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` server-only; never `NEXT_PUBLIC_`.
- Sanitize admin HTML on render (`sanitizeContent` / `SafeHtml`).
- Submissions + newsletter = PII; no public listing; no subscriber enumeration in errors.
- RLS/policy changes require `npm run test:rls`.

See `.cursor/docs/security.md`.
